From 6b9a262050150042c7f1e332e1799cbb6c4e50bd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nick McMillen <153555205+nmcmil@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 03:51:34 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] settings: add native read adapters and isolated fixture
 controls

Preserve the measured checkpoint: guarded build and installed spec runtime assertions pass; full native suite passes 10 of 11 targets. The remaining widget target requires the shared text-only display action API. Sound asset setup and immediate portal cancellation remain diagnosed failures, not accepted exceptions. Add private preview identity and actual chooser/service lifecycle assertions without enabling real-data preview.
